Z||000000||Seanh||09-29-2000||03:55 PM||||I have checked all the rubber coolent hose in the car today. None appear to be broken. I am begining to think it might be my week hole on the water pump. Could it be anything else? How difficult is it to remove the water pump? I have the rear end of the car up with 2 jackstands on the engine cradle, would it be alright to start the car and let it pump coolent through the system to see where it is comming from? or is there an eaisier way of finding it? Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
